1
00:00:05,715 --> 00:00:08,600
Meet Margin: a contract research workspace

2
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,652
for answers you can verify.

3
00:00:13,722 --> 00:00:16,820
Upload PDF or Word contracts. Each

4
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:20,222
document is saved with a clear processing status.

5
00:00:23,639 --> 00:00:26,462
The first agreement is ready. Let us ask

6
00:00:26,502 --> 00:00:28,252
about its liability cap.

7
00:00:35,672 --> 00:00:38,557
Ask a question in plain language. The agent

8
00:00:38,597 --> 00:00:40,870
searches the contract and reads the relevant

9
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:41,747
clause.

10
00:00:43,725 --> 00:00:46,010
The research steps appear live, so you can see

11
00:00:46,050 --> 00:00:47,375
what the agent checked.

12
00:00:50,718 --> 00:00:53,628
A quote is marked verified only after Margin

13
00:00:53,668 --> 00:00:55,718
finds it in this exact document.

14
00:01:06,757 --> 00:01:08,954
Open the citation to jump directly to the

15
00:01:08,994 --> 00:01:10,270
matching wording.

16
00:01:23,905 --> 00:01:26,728
PDFs open on their original pages, with

17
00:01:26,768 --> 00:01:29,330
an extracted text option beside them.

18
00:01:42,407 --> 00:01:44,854
Now the evidence is checked against this PDF

19
00:01:44,894 --> 00:01:46,944
before it appears as verified.

20
00:01:53,499 --> 00:01:56,284
The original PDF opens at the cited passage

21
00:01:56,324 --> 00:01:57,936
with a precise highlight.

22
00:02:07,554 --> 00:02:10,539
When wording repeats, move between occurrences

23
00:02:10,579 --> 00:02:12,392
to inspect the right one.

24
00:02:16,981 --> 00:02:19,778
Select two contract versions for a clause level

25
00:02:19,818 --> 00:02:20,918
comparison.

26
00:02:29,015 --> 00:02:31,412
The liability cap rises from one hundred

27
00:02:31,452 --> 00:02:34,312
thousand to one million dirhams, and the change

28
00:02:34,352 --> 00:02:36,290
is ranked by significance.

29
00:02:47,060 --> 00:02:49,782
Filter to high significance changes and inspect

30
00:02:49,822 --> 00:02:51,848
the before and after wording.

31
00:03:03,062 --> 00:03:05,660
The multi-round research loop shows each tool

32
00:03:05,700 --> 00:03:08,900
step and verifies quotes in the final answer.

33
00:03:16,063 --> 00:03:19,073
Known limits: scanned PDFs need OCR,

34
00:03:19,113 --> 00:03:21,573
and unusual layouts may use a labelled text

35
00:03:21,613 --> 00:03:22,526
fallback.

36
00:03:29,067 --> 00:03:31,890
The live app, source code, setup steps,

37
00:03:31,930 --> 00:03:34,804
and engineering note are linked in the README.
